{"id":"n66137-1-9","stage":5,"title":"심성 · 心性","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66137-1-9-1","ko":"지수가 이번에 내가 대회를 준비하는 것을 도와줬어.","zh":"这次智秀帮我准备了比赛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대회를","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"준비하는","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비하다：准备；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"준비하다","audio":"/audio/36170cc58deed32d9dce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86437","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것을","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도와줬어.","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"36170cc58deed32d","term":"준비하다","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/36170cc58deed32d9dce.mp3","entryId":"86437","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"1505f995680e9a46","term":"도와주다","zh":"帮忙，帮助","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3","entryId":"70744","definition":"帮别人做事或助人一臂之力。","pronunciation":["도와주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec54112c13963fe91279.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66137-1-9-2","ko":"지수는 참 심성이 착해. 저번에 나도 도와줬거든.","zh":"智秀的心地真的很好，上次她也帮过我呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심성이","meaning":"心性，性情","explanation":"심성：心性，性情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"심성","audio":"/audio/1459f24f62db710c1fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66137","senseId":"1","lemma":"심성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"착해.","meaning":"善良","explanation":"착하다：善良；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"착하다","audio":"/audio/44db3fd508e6c9f93bd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71732","senseId":"1","lemma":"착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저번에","meaning":"那次","explanation"